data: {"id": "e91965b989bf4f86-thinking-parallel_evidence-962", "run_id": "e91965b989bf4f86", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我需要基于已有的工具结果来分析这个 Pod 的 NotReady 状态。让我先整理已获取的关键证据。\n\n从已调用的工具和归档文件中，我可以看到以下关键信息：\n\n1. **kubectl_events** 显示：\n   - 56分钟前：Readiness probe failed - connection refused (172.16.104.16:8080)\n   - 79秒前（x1142次 over 56分钟）：Readiness probe failed - HTTP 503\n\n2. **kubectl_logs** 显示：\n   - 应用日志持续返回 HTTP 503 'dependency unavailable' 在 /work 路径\n\n3. **kubectl_describe** 显示：\n   - 同样记录了 Readiness probe 失败的警告事件\n\n4. **read_context_archive** 显示：\n   - Pod YAML 信息，UID: 705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee\n   - 节点：node2\n\n5", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789090263830, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

