data: {"id": "e91965b989bf4f86-thinking-parallel_evidence-1478", "run_id": "e91965b989bf4f86", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 修复结果\n\n**execute_pod_promql 已成功调用**，namespace 已正确传入 `aiops-case-09`。\n\n### 采集到的事实\n\n- **Pod 身份确认**：namespace=aiops-case-09, pod=workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc, UID=705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee, pod_ip=172.16.104.16, 节点=node2\n- **CPU 使用趋势**（00:33:31 ~ 01:29:53，56 个数据点）：\n  - 起始值：0.732s，最新值：8.287s\n  - 范围：[0.732, 8.287]\n  - 趋势可评估（trend_evaluable=true），显示容器 CPU 使用量在持续增长，说明容器进程是存活的且在进行计算活动\n- **容器信息**：container=app, image=xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine\n\n### 证据小结\n\nCPU 指标趋势增长表明该 P", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789090379994, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

