otReady (Ready=False) → 流量被剔除，业务服务中断\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n*   **已确认根因**：应用依赖服务故障。\n*   **证据支撑**：\n    *   应用日志 (`fact-logging`) 明确记录 `dependency unavailable`。\n    *   Trace 数据 (`fact-224c2dfe1934`) 显示 `/work` 端点返回 `503`。\n    *   K8s 探针事件 (`fact-e58bac71fac8`) 证实了应用层返回了 `503`。\n*   **局限说明**：日志和探针虽指出了“依赖不可用”，但未明确指出具体是哪个下游服务或组件（如数据库、中间件）名称缺失，因此具体依赖对象仍为“未确认”。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 4.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 237.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 237.2s (Evidence 223.0s, RCA 14.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 268.387, "metrics": {"run_id": "e91965b989bf4f86", "mttr": {"value": "4.5m", "seconds": 268.39067935943604, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", 